{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@objc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enableUniversalLinks","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enabled","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether universal link handling is enabled."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"enabled"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"Configuration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" object."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/UniversalLinking"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When this property is enabled, the SDK will pass web links that are triggered by an experience back to the host"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application to process. The host application should implement the "},{"code":"application(_:continue:restorationHandler:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in its "},{"code":"ApplicationDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to return "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if the link provided in the given "},{"code":"NSUserActivity","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has been handled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a universal link inside the current application, or "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if not. When a value of "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is returned, this informs the SDK"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that no further link handling is needed. When a value of "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is returned, the SDK will continue handling the link and open"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the web destination in the browser."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When this property is disabled, any web links triggered by an experience will always be opened in the browser, regardless of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether it was a universal link that may have been intended to deep link to another screen in the app."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default value for this configuration is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"AppcuesKit"}],"externalID":"s:10AppcuesKit0A0C6ConfigC20enableUniversalLinksyAEXDSbF","title":"enableUniversalLinks(_:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enableUniversalLinks","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the universal link handling preference for the configuration."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues\/Config\/enableUniversalLinks(_:)"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/appcueskit\/appcues\/config\/enableuniversallinks(_:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit","doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues","doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues\/Config"]]},"references":{"doc://com.appcues.sdk/documentation/AppcuesKit/Appcues/Config":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Config","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/appcueskit\/appcues\/config","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A configuration object that defines behavior and policies for Appcues."}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Config","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues\/Config","title":"Appcues.Config"},"doc://com.appcues.sdk/documentation/AppcuesKit/Appcues":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Appcues","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An object that manages Appcues tracking and rendering of experience content, for your app."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Appcues","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Appcues","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/appcueskit\/appcues"},"doc://com.appcues.sdk/documentation/AppcuesKit/UniversalLinking":{"role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/UniversalLinking","url":"\/documentation\/appcueskit\/universallinking","title":"Configuring Handling of Universal Links","abstract":[{"text":"The Appcues iOS SDK supports universal links as an option for deep linking to screens within your app.","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.appcues.sdk/documentation/AppcuesKit/Appcues/Config/enableUniversalLinks(_:)":{"